# 统一换行符，避免跨平台提交产生整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# Gradle 包装脚本必须使用 LF，否则在 Linux / macOS 上无法执行
gradlew text eol=lf

# Windows 批处理保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 若后续引入二进制资源，一律标记为 binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.so binary
*.onnx binary
*.wav binary
*.ttf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
